{
  "datapack": "iot-edge-adlc",
  "note": "Ten team members, each paired with one agent. Every agent reads and writes the same Meko datapack under its own agent_id, so decisions made by one are recalled by the others instead of being re-derived from the full corpus. Owners are pseudonymous team ids (TM-01…TM-10) plus role — no personal names are stored in the repo, sent to Claude, written to Meko or posted to GitHub.",
